<ul><li>付属のzipファイル「RPG_RT.exe(PASS=v)」を解凍してください。パスワードは「v」です。
</li></ul>
<ul><li>解凍後、フォルダ内にある「RPG_RT.exe」を「★りどみ.txt」「RPG_RT.ini」等がある階層に移動してください。
</li></ul>
<ul><li>「RPG_RT.exe」を起動してください。
</li></ul></div></div><div id="game_comments_6545472" class="game_comments_widget base_widget"><h2 id="comments">Comments</h2><p class="form_placeholder"><a href="https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fajitamar2k.itch.io%2Ftourism-of-the-sinking-move" data-register_action="comment">Log in with itch.io</a> to leave a comment.</p><div id="community_topic_posts_9737192" class="community_topic_posts_widget base_widget"><div id="community_post_list_638473" class="community_post_list_widget base_widget"><div data-post="{&quot;id&quot;:16561768,&quot;user_id&quot;:18228396}" class="community_post has_vote_column has_replies" id="post-16561768"><div id="first-post" class="post_anchor"></div><div id="last-post" class="post_anchor"></div><div class="post_grid"><div class="post_votes"><a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fajitamar2k.itch.io%2Ftourism-of-the-sinking-move" data-register_action="community_vote" class="vote_up_btn vote_btn" title="Vote up"><svg role="img" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" version="1.1" aria-hidden class="svgicon icon_vote_up" width="20"><polygon points="2 18 12 6 22 18" /></svg></a> <a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fajitamar2k.itch.io%2Ftourism-of-the-sinking-move" data-register_action="community_vote" class="vote_down_btn vote_btn" title="Vote down"><svg role="img" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" version="1.1" aria-hidden class="svgicon icon_vote_down" width="20"><polygon points="2 6 12 18 22 6" /></svg></a></div><a class="avatar_container" href="https://itch.io/profile/trpg-enaga"><div class="post_avatar" style="background-image: url(/static/images/frog-cyan.png)"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="https://itch.io/profile/trpg-enaga">TRPG_enaga</a></span><span title="2026-07-13 17:39:14" class="post_date"><a href="https://itch.io/post/16561768">99 days ago</a></span><span class="vote_counts"></span></div><div class="post_content"><div class="post_body user_formatted" dir="auto"><p></p>
<p>『沈む一手のツーリズム』を楽しませていただいています。</p>
<p>セーブデータの読み込みができなくて、困っています。</p>
<p>「Save.lgs」「Save01.lsd」「Save02.lsd」などのセーブデータらしきファイルはあります。どう対処すればよろしいでしょうか？</p></div><div class="post_footer"><a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fajitamar2k.itch.io%2Ftourism-of-the-sinking-move" data-register_action="community_reply" class="post_action reply_btn">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div class="community_post_replies top_level_replies"><div data-post="{&quot;id&quot;:16564918,&quot;user_id&quot;:14697852}" class="community_post has_vote_column is_reply has_replies" id="post-16564918"><div class="post_grid"><div class="post_votes"><a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fajitamar2k.itch.io%2Ftourism-of-the-sinking-move" data-register_action="community_vote" class="vote_up_btn vote_btn" title="Vote up"><svg role="img" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" version="1.1" aria-hidden class="svgicon icon_vote_up" width="20"><polygon points="2 18 12 6 22 18" /></svg></a> <a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fajitamar2k.itch.io%2Ftourism-of-the-sinking-move" data-register_action="community_vote" class="vote_down_btn vote_btn" title="Vote down"><svg role="img" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" version="1.1" aria-hidden class="svgicon icon_vote_down" width="20"><polygon points="2 6 12 18 22 6" /></svg></a></div><a class="avatar_container" href="https://itch.io/profile/ajitamar2k"><div class="post_avatar" style="background-image: url(/static/images/frog-red.png)"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="https://itch.io/profile/ajitamar2k">あじたま</a></span><span title="2026-07-14 01:47:20" class="post_date"><a href="https://itch.io/post/16564918">98 days ago</a></span><span class="vote_counts"></span></div><div class="post_content"><div class="post_body user_formatted" dir="auto"><p>報告ありがとうございます。</p><p>タイトル画面で「つづきから」を選択してもデータを読み込む事ができず、ゲームを途中から再開できないという状況でしょうか。</p><p>そもそも「つづきから」を選択できないのであれば、「Save.lgs」「Save01.lsd」「Save02.lsd」のファイルが「RPG_RT.exe」や「Map0001.lmu」、「★りどみ.txt」等と同じフォルダにあるかご確認ください。</p><p>「Save.lgs」「Save01.lsd」「Save02.lsd」の3つのファイルが正しい場所にあれば、ロードすることができると思われます。</p></div><div class="post_footer"><a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fajitamar2k.itch.io%2Ftourism-of-the-sinking-move" data-register_action="community_reply" class="post_action reply_btn">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div class="community_post_replies"><div data-post="{&quot;id&quot;:16565435,&quot;user_id&quot;:18228396}" class="community_post has_vote_column is_reply has_replies" id="post-16565435"><div class="post_grid"><div class="post_votes"><a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fajitamar2k.itch.io%2Ftourism-of-the-sinking-move" data-register_action="community_vote" class="vote_up_btn vote_btn" title="Vote up"><svg role="img" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" version="1.1" aria-hidden class="svgicon icon_vote_up" width="20"><polygon points="2 18 12 6 22 18" /></svg></a> <a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fajitamar2k.itch.io%2Ftourism-of-the-sinking-move" data-register_action="community_vote" class="vote_down_btn vote_btn" title="Vote down"><svg role="img" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" version="1.1" aria-hidden class="svgicon icon_vote_down" width="20"><polygon points="2 6 12 18 22 6" /></svg></a></div><a class="avatar_container" href="https://itch.io/profile/trpg-enaga"><div class="post_avatar" style="background-image: url(/static/images/frog-cyan.png)"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="https://itch.io/profile/trpg-enaga">TRPG_enaga</a></span><span title="2026-07-14 03:26:32" class="post_date"><a href="https://itch.io/post/16565435">98 days ago</a></span><span class="vote_counts"></span></div><div class="post_content"><div class="post_body user_formatted" dir="auto"><p>返答ありがとうございます。</p><p>タイトル画面で「つづきから」を選択することができません。</p><p>「Save.lgs」「Save01.lsd」「Save02.lsd」は「RPG_RT.exe」と同じファイルの階層にあります(セーブ後にデータの階層を移すなどの行為は行っていません)。<br></p></div><div class="post_footer"><a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fajitamar2k.itch.io%2Ftourism-of-the-sinking-move" data-register_action="community_reply" class="post_action reply_btn">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div class="community_post_replies"><div data-post="{&quot;id&quot;:16567407,&quot;user_id&quot;:14697852}" class="community_post has_vote_column is_reply has_replies" id="post-16567407"><div class="post_grid"><div class="post_votes"><a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fajitamar2k.itch.io%2Ftourism-of-the-sinking-move" data-register_action="community_vote" class="vote_up_btn vote_btn" title="Vote up"><svg role="img" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" version="1.1" aria-hidden class="svgicon icon_vote_up" width="20"><polygon points="2 18 12 6 22 18" /></svg></a> <a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fajitamar2k.itch.io%2Ftourism-of-the-sinking-move" data-register_action="community_vote" class="vote_down_btn vote_btn" title="Vote down"><svg role="img" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" version="1.1" aria-hidden class="svgicon icon_vote_down" width="20"><polygon points="2 6 12 18 22 6" /></svg></a></div><a class="avatar_container" href="https://itch.io/profile/ajitamar2k"><div class="post_avatar" style="background-image: url(/static/images/frog-red.png)"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="https://itch.io/profile/ajitamar2k">あじたま</a></span><span title="2026-07-14 10:48:57" class="post_date"><a href="https://itch.io/post/16567407">98 days ago</a></span><span class="vote_counts"></span></div><div class="post_content"><div class="post_body user_formatted" dir="auto"><p>返信ありがとうございます。</p><p>exeファイルは、「★りどみ.txt」の起動方法に記載されている手順で用意したものでしょうか。</p><p>exeファイルを他所から持ってきた場合、古いバージョンの実行ファイルになっている可能性があり、正常に動作しないことがあります。</p><p><br></p><p>問題ないのであれば、原因は不明ですが、セーブデータが正しく存在できていない可能性があります。</p><p>その場合、以下の手順を試していただけると助かります。</p><p>・セーブファイル(「Save.lgs」「Save01.lsd」「Save02.lsd」の3つ)を別の場所にバックアップする。</p><p>・「はじめから」でゲームを開始。一度セーブをした後、そのデータをロードできるかどうか確認する。</p><p>・バックアップしておいたセーブファイルを元の場所に戻す。</p><p>ゲームの仕様上、セーブデータは一つしか保持できないので上書きにご注意ください。</p></div><div class="post_footer"><a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fajitamar2k.itch.io%2Ftourism-of-the-sinking-move" data-register_action="community_reply" class="post_action reply_btn">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div class="community_post_replies"><div data-post="{&quot;id&quot;:16567670,&quot;user_id&quot;:18228396}" class="community_post has_vote_column is_reply has_replies" id="post-16567670"><div class="post_grid"><div class="post_votes"><a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fajitamar2k.itch.io%2Ftourism-of-the-sinking-move" data-register_action="community_vote" class="vote_up_btn vote_btn" title="Vote up"><svg role="img" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" version="1.1" aria-hidden class="svgicon icon_vote_up" width="20"><polygon points="2 18 12 6 22 18" /></svg></a> <a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fajitamar2k.itch.io%2Ftourism-of-the-sinking-move" data-register_action="community_vote" class="vote_down_btn vote_btn" title="Vote down"><svg role="img" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" version="1.1" aria-hidden class="svgicon icon_vote_down" width="20"><polygon points="2 6 12 18 22 6" /></svg></a></div><a class="avatar_container" href="https://itch.io/profile/trpg-enaga"><div class="post_avatar" style="background-image: url(/static/images/frog-cyan.png)"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="https://itch.io/profile/trpg-enaga">TRPG_enaga</a></span><span title="2026-07-14 11:40:56" class="post_date"><a href="https://itch.io/post/16567670">98 days ago</a></span><span class="vote_counts"></span></div><div class="post_content"><div class="post_body user_formatted" dir="auto"><p>再度「★りどみ.txt」の起動方法に記載されている手順で「RPG_RT」をDLし、「★りどみ.txt」等と同じファイルの階層に移動させましたが、セーブデータを読み取ることができませんでした。</p>
<p>exeファイルを他所から持ってくるなどの行為はしていません。</p></div><div class="post_footer"><a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fajitamar2k.itch.io%2Ftourism-of-the-sinking-move" data-register_action="community_reply" class="post_action reply_btn">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div class="community_post_replies"><div data-post="{&quot;id&quot;:16573849,&quot;user_id&quot;:14697852}" class="community_post has_vote_column is_reply has_replies" id="post-16573849"><div class="post_grid"><div class="post_votes"><a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fajitamar2k.itch.io%2Ftourism-of-the-sinking-move" data-register_action="community_vote" class="vote_up_btn vote_btn" title="Vote up"><svg role="img" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" version="1.1" aria-hidden class="svgicon icon_vote_up" width="20"><polygon points="2 18 12 6 22 18" /></svg></a> <a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fajitamar2k.itch.io%2Ftourism-of-the-sinking-move" data-register_action="community_vote" class="vote_down_btn vote_btn" title="Vote down"><svg role="img" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" version="1.1" aria-hidden class="svgicon icon_vote_down" width="20"><polygon points="2 6 12 18 22 6" /></svg></a></div><a class="avatar_container" href="https://itch.io/profile/ajitamar2k"><div class="post_avatar" style="background-image: url(/static/images/frog-red.png)"></div></a><div class="post_header"><span class="post_author"><a href="https://itch.io/profile/ajitamar2k">あじたま</a></span><span title="2026-07-15 03:27:06" class="post_date"><a href="https://itch.io/post/16573849">97 days ago</a></span><span class="vote_counts"></span></div><div class="post_content"><div class="post_body user_formatted" dir="auto"><p>返信ありがとうございます。</p><p>強制的にセーブデータを読み込むパッチを投稿してみました。こちらを適用していただけると助かります。</p><p>ゲームページから「強制読込パッチ.zip」をダウンロードしてください。</p><p>ダウンロードした「RPG_RT.ldb」をゲームフォルダ内の「★りどみ.txt」「RPG_RT.ini」「Map0001.lmu」などがある階層に配置することで、パッチを適用できます。</p></div><div class="post_footer"><a href="https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fajitamar2k.itch.io%2Ftourism-of-the-sinking-move" data-register_action="community_reply" class="post_action reply_btn">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div class="view_more_replies"><a class="button outline forward_link" href="https://itch.io/post/16573849">View more in thread</a></div></div></div></div></div></div><script id="vote_counts_tpl" type="text/template"><% if (up_score > 0) { %><span class="upvotes">(+{{up_score}})</span><% } %><% if (down_score > 0) { %><span class="downvotes">(-{{down_score}})</span><% } %></script></div></div></div></div><div class="right_col column"><div class="video_embed"></div><div class="screenshot_list"><a data-image_lightbox="true" target="_blank" href="https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNDQ5MTM2OS8yNjgzODM0My5wbmc=/original/QahgFg.png"><img data-screenshot_id="26838343" src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNDQ5MTM2OS8yNjgzODM0My5wbmc=/347x500/czXNC9.png" class="screenshot" srcset="https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNDQ5MTM2OS8yNjgzODM0My5wbmc=/347x500/czXNC9.png 1x, https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNDQ5MTM2OS8yNjgzODM0My5wbmc=/794x1000/eUkEwC.png 2x"/></a><a data-image_lightbox="true" target="_blank" href="https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNDQ5MTM2OS8yNjgzODM0NC5wbmc=/original/SVe0sS.png"><img data-screenshot_id="26838344" src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNDQ5MTM2OS8yNjgzODM0NC5wbmc=/347x500/wYjUYo.png" class="screenshot" srcset="https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNDQ5MTM2OS8yNjgzODM0NC5wbmc=/347x500/wYjUYo.png 1x, https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNDQ5MTM2OS8yNjgzODM0NC5wbmc=/794x1000/BiuoYC.png 2x"/></a></div></div></div></div><div id="view_game_footer" class="footer"><a href="https://itch.io/" class="icon_logo"><svg role="img" height="17" viewBox="0 0 262.728 235.452" version="1.1" aria-hidden class="svgicon icon_itchio_new" width="20"><path d="M31.99 1.365C21.287 7.72.2 31.945 0 38.298v10.516C0 62.144 12.46 73.86 23.773 73.86c13.584 0 24.902-11